{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience the Timber Fever</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get hired as one of the many disposable beavers tasked with cutting down <strong>Tree of Life</strong> and defeating its <strong>Protectors</strong>. Work nonstop day and night shifts to bring the tree down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you don't make it, don't worry. The next one will.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your shift and get to work cutting down the Tree. Once your shift is over, <strong>buy</strong> <strong>items </strong>that help you cut it faster. Be careful, at <strong>night</strong>\u00a0even more <strong>Protectors</strong>\u00a0will try to defend the Tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let the Protectors stop you. <strong>Find the balance</strong> between working and fighting to avoid getting fired.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 unique items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful pixel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute beavers</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4081680?t=1760457399","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4081680?t=1760457399","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081680/dc52c6d3d4eb2c99d763133f76ec9b4ba9e97d76/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760457399","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081680/dc52c6d3d4eb2c99d763133f76ec9b4ba9e97d76/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760457399","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience the T